            "description": "Get paginated list of brokers for dashboard display\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `page`: Page number (default: 1)\n- `limit`: Records per page (default: 50, max: 200)\n- `search`: Search term (optional)\n- `city`: Filter by city (optional)\n\n**Response:** Broker list with pagination metadata"
